      99.57,
      373.43,
      148.61
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 3 of the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act, No. 3 of 2016 and the legal effect of that section as amended to increase the national minimum monthly wage by Rs. 9,500 and national minimum daily wage by Rs. 380 with effect from April 1, 2025 to December 31, 2025 and further to increase the national minimum monthly wage by Rs. 3000 and national minimum daily wage by Rs. 120 with effect from January 1, 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
