    ],
    "text": "An Act to amend the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act, No. 3 of 2016",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT-SC700"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      140.83,
      309.71,
      165.97
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      176.64,
      309.72,
      201.97
    ],
    "text": "1. (1) This Act may be cited as the National Minimum Wage of Workers (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      212.83,
      309.71,
      237.97
    ],
    "text": "(2) The provisions of this Act shall be deemed to have come into operation on April 1, 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      248.64,
      309.7,
      297.97
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 3 of the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act, No. 3 of 2016 is hereby amended by the repeal of subsection (1) thereof and the substitution therefor, of the following: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      91.2,
      308.67,
      309.72,
      381.97
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(l) (a) For the period commencing on April 1, 2025 and ending on December 31, 2025, the national minimum monthly wage for all workers in any industry or service shall be twenty-seven thousand rupees, and the national minimum daily wage of a worker shall be one thousand eighty rupees.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      91.2,
      392.67,
      309.72,
      453.97
    ],
    "text": "(b) With effect from January 1, 2026, the national minimum monthly wage for all workers in any industry or service shall be thirty thousand rupees, and the national minimum daily wage of a worker shall be one thousand two hundred.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      79.2,
      464.64,
      307.19,
      477.97
    ],
    "text": "3. For the avoidance of doubt, it is hereby declared that -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      488.67,
      309.71,
      549.97
    ],
    "text": "(a) the budgetary relief allowances payable as at March 31,2025, under the provisions of the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No. 36 of 2005, the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No. 4 of 2016, or both, shall form",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
