    "text": "part of the national minimum monthly or daily wage specified in section 2 payable to all workers in any industry or service; and (b) the wage of any worker who, as at March 31, 2025, received a wage that included the budgetary relief allowances under the provisions of the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No. 36 of 2005, the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No. 4 of 2016, or both such Acts, shall, from the date of commencement of this Act, consolidate such allowances as part of such wage of such worker.",
